# guide tab - basic fields
plant-analyzer-guide-yield       = Yield: how many units of produce the plant drops per harvest.
plant-analyzer-guide-potency     = Potency: scales the strength of chemicals in the produce (1-100%).
plant-analyzer-guide-harvest     = Harvest type: Ephemeral dies after one harvest. Perennial regrows. Self-harvesting drops produce on its own.
plant-analyzer-guide-lifespan    = Lifespan: total growth cycles before the plant dies of old age.
plant-analyzer-guide-maturation  = Maturation: cycles needed to reach harvestable stage.
plant-analyzer-guide-production  = Production: cycles between harvests (perennial plants).
plant-analyzer-guide-growthstages = Growth stages: number of visual growth steps before maturity.
plant-analyzer-guide-endurance   = Endurance: maximum health pool of the plant.

# guide tab - tolerance fields
plant-analyzer-guide-nutrient    = Nutrient usage: how much nutriment is consumed per growth cycle. Lower is better.
plant-analyzer-guide-water       = Water usage: how much water is consumed per growth cycle. Lower is better.
plant-analyzer-guide-heat        = Ideal heat / Heat tolerance: target temperature in Kelvin and how far it can deviate before losing health.
plant-analyzer-guide-light       = Ideal light / Light tolerance: target light level in candela and acceptable deviation.
plant-analyzer-guide-toxins      = Toxin tolerance: how much toxin buildup the plant can handle before taking damage.
plant-analyzer-guide-pressure    = Low/High pressure tolerance: safe atmospheric pressure range in kPa.
plant-analyzer-guide-pests       = Pest tolerance: resistance to pest infestations. Higher means it survives longer.
plant-analyzer-guide-weeds       = Weed tolerance: resistance to weed takeover. Higher means it competes better.

# guide tab - mutation fields
plant-analyzer-guide-kudzu       = Kudzufication: the plant spreads aggressively and takes over nearby trays.
plant-analyzer-guide-seedless    = Seedless: produce does not contain seeds, preventing further propagation.
plant-analyzer-guide-ligneous    = Ligneous: produce is hard and woody, may affect processing.
plant-analyzer-guide-screaming   = Mandragora: the plant emits a scream when disturbed.
